cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived data, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "thermal-equity-data-integrity"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for a study of how illicit data markets
  distort AI-assisted urban forest planning: a proof-of-concept experiment on
  satellite-derived land surface temperature and gridded population for
  Nanjing, China, a synthetic replication, and robustness runs that repeat the
  experiment under four estimators, in eight Chinese cities, and under
  alternative grid resolutions, seeds, vulnerable-set definitions and
  planting budgets.
type: software
